// #897/#855 (ADR-0070 Phase 1): implicit membership fixture. `explicit_fn`
// is provided by an explicitly `import`ed impl file (the old idiom);
// `implicit_fn` is provided by `extra.vibe`, which this contract never
// imports at all -- it's only found via .vpkg's unconditional sibling
// auto-discovery. `_scratch.vibe` and `internal_test.vibe` each export a
// name NOT declared here; if either were wrongly swept into the impl set,
// conformance-checking would fail on their extraneous export.

fn explicit_fn(x: Int) -> Int
fn implicit_fn(x: Int) -> Int
